## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Gmail API Setup**: Running the Gmail API for the first time requires downloading OAuth 2.0 Client Credentials (`credentials.json`) from Google Cloud Console with the `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/gmail.send` scope.
> - **Twilio Credentials**: If downloading media from Twilio, `TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID` and `TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN` are passed to `requests` for authenticated media fetching.

